{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgKi77y4L78yoQs8utpTi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Why:** `VisitSummaryPdfReport` enforces the `App: Can generate a Visit Summary` privilege, but nothing declared it. OpenMRS creates privilege rows from the module's `config.xml`, so the row never existed and no role could be given it. Only superusers could generate the PDF. The PR description says the same: \"that made it un-grantable and left visit summary PDF generation effectively superuser-only.\" I did not check how OpenMRS core handles superuser privilege checks, so that part rests on the PR's account.\n\n**Fix:** Commit `9fc46c2` (merge of PR #31, \"Declare Visit Summary privilege in config.xml\") adds a `<privilege>` entry for `App: Can generate a Visit Summary` to `omod/src/main/resources/config.xml`, following the sticker and encounter-forms entries next to it. The diff is 5 added lines and no code changes. The PR links ticket O3-5667.\n\n**Evidence, best first:**\n\n1. `openmrs-module-patientdocuments/omod/src/main/resources/config.xml` lines 55-58: the newly declared privilege (the fix).\n2. Same file, lines 44-53: the existing sticker and encounter-forms declarations that the fix copies.\n3. `openmrs-module-patientdocuments/api/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/patientdocuments/reports/VisitSummaryPdfReport.java` line 89: `Context.requirePrivilege(VIEW_VISIT_SUMMARY)`, the check that could never pass for non-superusers before the fix.\n4. `openmrs-module-patientdocuments/api/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/patientdocuments/common/PatientDocumentsPrivilegeConstants.java` line 18: the constant's value, which matches the declared name.\n5. PR #31 (the PR description states the root cause and links O3-5667).\n6. Commit 9fc46c2 (the merge commit, merged 2026-07-20).\n\n```json\n[\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-module-patientdocuments/omod/src/main/resources/config.xml\", \"startLine\": 55, \"endLine\": 58},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-module-patientdocuments/omod/src/main/resources/config.xml\", \"startLine\": 44, \"endLine\": 53},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-module-patientdocuments/api/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/patientdocuments/reports/VisitSummaryPdfReport.java\", \"startLine\": 89, \"endLine\": 89},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-module-patientdocuments/api/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/patientdocuments/common/PatientDocumentsPrivilegeConstants.java\", \"startLine\": 18, \"endLine\": 18},\n  {\"repo\": \"openmrs-module-patientdocuments\", \"pr\": 31},\n  {\"repo\": \"openmrs-module-patientdocuments\", \"commit\": \"9fc46c2cf8f6b7d3f2758379ac9b7af2d848b22a\"},\n  {\"ticket\": \"O3-5667\"}\n]\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2584,"cache_read_input_tokens":26260,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2584},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6828b757-b179-4c60-9de7-9da63bdef9bc","uuid":"d7bb86bb-2440-42a3-ba5d-0c2c85686f09","timestamp":"2026-10-23T19:19:46.577Z","request_id":"req_011CgKi77gSgJWjsHVyo2aWC"}
